Senior Full-Stack Engineer with 6+ years of experience building web and mobile products. I work across the stack: React, Next.js and React Native on the front end; Node.js, NestJS, Prisma and PostgreSQL on the back end. At TipTip I'm currently building AI agents.

I specialize in complex front-end systems: AI-driven interfaces, real-time dashboards and geospatial mapping with Mapbox GL, with a strong focus on performance and pixel-perfect UI. I've worked with international, cross-functional teams across SaaS, AI, real estate, healthcare and e-commerce.

I hold a BSc in Computer Science from An-Najah National University, and I care about clean architecture, fast interfaces, and shipping things people actually use.
